{
  "id": "senalabierta-kofi-pagos",
  "name": "Señal Abierta - Ko-fi pagos (poll)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Cada 3 horas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://senalabierta.pages.dev/api/kofi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Leer pagos /api/kofi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const st = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nst.ids = st.ids || [];\nconst body = $input.first().json;\nconst payments = Array.isArray(body.payments) ? body.payments : [];\n\n// Primera ejecución: siembra sin notificar nada (evita agradecer los pagos históricos)\nif (st.seeded !== true) {\n  st.seeded = true;\n  st.ids = payments.map(p => p.id);\n  return [];\n}\n\nconst fresh = payments.filter(p => !st.ids.includes(p.id));\nst.ids = [...st.ids, ...fresh.map(p => p.id)].slice(-500);\n\nreturn fresh.map(p => ({\n  json: {\n    id: p.id,\n    type: p.type,\n    amount: p.amount,\n    currency: p.currency || 'USD',\n    from: p.from || 'anónimo',\n    note: p.note || '',\n    ts: p.ts,\n    summary: `${p.type || 'payment'} de ${p.amount} ${p.currency || 'USD'} de ${p.from || 'anónimo'}`\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Filtrar pagos nuevos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "PEGA_AQUI_ID_DE_TU_GOOGLE_SHEET"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Hoja 1"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "fecha": "={{ $json.ts }}",
            "tipo": "={{ $json.type }}",
            "importe": "={{ $json.amount }}",
            "moneda": "={{ $json.currency }}",
            "de": "={{ $json.from }}",
            "mensaje": "={{ $json.note }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Fila en Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [660, 0],
      "disabled": true,
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PEGA_AQUI_CREDENCIAL",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flujo Ko-fi → n8n\n\n1. Ko-fi NO se apunta aquí: su único webhook va a senalabierta.pages.dev/api/kofi (KV + dashboard), que está siempre en pie.\n2. Este workflow consulta GET /api/kofi cada 3 h y detecta pagos nuevos por id (primera ejecución = siembra, sin notificar).\n3. Para actuar: habilita el nodo de Google Sheets (y/o añade Gmail/Discord tras el nodo de filtro) con tus credenciales.\n\nGuía completa: promo/n8n.md",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "a1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, -260]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cada 3 horas": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Leer pagos /api/kofi",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Leer pagos /api/kofi": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filtrar pagos nuevos",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filtrar pagos nuevos": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fila en Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
